WEBVTT

00:03.410 --> 00:06.450
Your Highness, may I have a moment?

00:08.080 --> 00:09.190
Your Highness?

00:12.320 --> 00:13.360
Your Highness!

00:13.800 --> 00:15.100
Are you all right?

00:15.100 --> 00:16.170
Yes.

00:16.170 --> 00:18.870
It's nothing. I'm just a 
little tired, that's all.

00:19.390 --> 00:24.410
If you aren't feeling well, then why not go 
to the Imperial Cross Hospital for an exam?

00:24.410 --> 00:27.320
There's no need for that. 
It's just mild dizziness.

00:28.730 --> 00:31.510
I experience this level of 
dizziness all the time.

00:31.790 --> 00:36.370
If you experience dizziness regularly, 
it may indicate something else.

00:36.370 --> 00:38.540
It won't take up much of your time.

00:38.540 --> 00:41.020
Won't you allow someone to examine you?

00:41.020 --> 00:42.080
Your Highness?

00:42.780 --> 00:44.020
It's nothing.

02:20.370 --> 02:22.000
It's Graham.

02:22.000 --> 02:22.940
Come in.

02:32.300 --> 02:33.240
Is something wrong?

02:33.240 --> 02:35.730
No, nothing's wrong.

02:37.710 --> 02:39.790
<i>That gentleman is Viscount Ven.</i>

02:41.230 --> 02:42.830
Who's the young lady?

02:42.830 --> 02:46.230
An apprentice who has just 
joined us. Is something wrong?

02:46.580 --> 02:49.720
No. I just feel like I've 
seen her somewhere before.

02:49.960 --> 02:51.220
<i>This is bad!</i>

02:51.220 --> 02:55.240
<i>Viscount Ven has been performing my 
medical exams since I was little.</i>

02:55.240 --> 02:58.480
<i>What do I do if he realizes that I'm Elise?</i>

02:58.930 --> 03:02.220
<i>That young lady would never 
become an apprentice.</i>

03:02.620 --> 03:04.440
It's nothing.

03:04.440 --> 03:06.540
It must just be an uncanny resemblance.

03:06.540 --> 03:07.640
I see.

03:08.630 --> 03:10.430
This is Viscount Ven.

03:10.430 --> 03:14.930
He works at the Imperial Cross Hospital. 
He's the greatest doctor in the empire.

03:14.930 --> 03:17.170
Please show him every respect.

03:17.390 --> 03:18.300
Yes, sir.

03:19.680 --> 03:23.680
No need to be so formal! 
Please, tell me how it happened.

03:23.950 --> 03:27.070
You're referring to the splenectomy 
performed the other day, correct?

03:27.070 --> 03:30.680
Yes! That achievement will be 
etched into medical history!

03:30.680 --> 03:32.690
I very much want to hear about it!

03:32.690 --> 03:34.010
Well...

03:34.590 --> 03:37.640
It isn't me you should be asking. It's her.

03:39.400 --> 03:40.890
Why her?

03:41.710 --> 03:45.770
Because she's the one who 
performed the surgery.

03:46.070 --> 03:49.280
Graham! This is no time for jokes!

03:49.280 --> 03:51.700
I just told you to show 
him respect, didn't I?

03:52.730 --> 03:55.080
Well, you've put me in a difficult spot.

03:55.960 --> 03:59.590
Miss, is what Graham said true?

04:01.990 --> 04:04.460
Yes, I performed the surgery.

04:05.070 --> 04:08.590
I'm sorry. It all sounds 
like a fabrication to me.

04:08.590 --> 04:10.470
You're still an apprentice, aren't you?

04:11.050 --> 04:14.790
I've always wholeheartedly 
wanted to become a doctor,

04:14.790 --> 04:17.850
so books which form the basis of modern 
medicine, such as the works of Grantham,

04:17.850 --> 04:20.370
provided me a foundation for study.

04:20.780 --> 04:25.370
As I did so, I was always searching for 
better treatment methods.

04:26.060 --> 04:29.270
The splenectomy that we 
performed in this instance

04:29.270 --> 04:32.820
is a surgery I've turned over 
many times in my mind.

04:33.420 --> 04:35.520
<i>That's not the truth,</i>

04:35.520 --> 04:39.430
<i>but even if I told them I was a surgeon in 
my previous life, they wouldn't believe me.</i>

04:39.930 --> 04:42.010
You're saying you thought it up on your own?

04:42.470 --> 04:44.590
I find that completely unbelievable.

04:44.590 --> 04:48.060
If you truly are the one who performed it,

04:48.060 --> 04:52.530
then can you explain how you executed 
the surgery to us right now?

04:53.010 --> 04:53.940
Yes.

04:54.900 --> 04:58.720
In this case, the patient's spleen 
had been penetrated by a bullet.

04:58.720 --> 05:00.970
Stopping the bleeding was 
incredibly difficult.

05:01.400 --> 05:05.780
But by removing the spleen itself and 
tying off the blood vessels further down,

05:05.780 --> 05:08.940
I believed he might have a chance at survival.

05:09.270 --> 05:12.590
First, I performed a midline incision.

05:12.590 --> 05:14.490
Why a midline incision?

05:14.490 --> 05:18.560
The spleen isn't located in the center 
of the body. It's on the left side.

05:18.560 --> 05:21.080
The spleen is located on the left side,

05:21.080 --> 05:23.460
but the pancreas is centrally located.

05:23.460 --> 05:24.720
The pancreas?

05:25.190 --> 05:28.710
Yes. The spleen and pancreas are connected.

05:28.710 --> 05:33.230
Because of this, there was a need to detach 
the spleen from the back of the pancreas.

05:33.750 --> 05:38.170
Once the pancreas was detached, we 
next cut the surrounding ligaments.

05:38.730 --> 05:41.740
You couldn't remove the 
spleen at that point?

05:42.030 --> 05:44.980
In order to increase the
probability of success,

05:44.980 --> 05:47.780
we needed to rotate the 
orientation of the spleen.

05:48.110 --> 05:53.600
Since the ligaments hold the spleen 
in place, we had to sever them first.

05:55.250 --> 05:56.610
That concludes my explanation.

05:57.030 --> 05:58.650
Amazing.

05:58.650 --> 06:00.620
Is this even possible?

06:00.620 --> 06:04.320
It's only been a month since she came here!

06:04.740 --> 06:06.440
You said your name is Rose?

06:06.440 --> 06:07.510
Yes, sir.

06:07.510 --> 06:12.520
Why don't you leave this place and work 
at Imperial Cross Hospital with me?

06:13.500 --> 06:14.760
Are you insane?

06:14.760 --> 06:17.150
You heard her explanation, didn't you?

06:17.150 --> 06:20.390
I want to see her abilities in person!

06:20.720 --> 06:22.620
<i>Imperial Cross Hospital...</i>

06:23.270 --> 06:26.910
<i>In both reputation and reality, it's the
empire's greatest medical institution!</i>

06:26.910 --> 06:28.660
<i>I could work there?</i>

06:29.700 --> 06:31.440
Don't speak nonsense!

06:31.440 --> 06:34.640
To do that, she'd have to pass the exam first.

06:35.090 --> 06:38.190
Have you forgotten? 
This year, the exam will be...

06:38.480 --> 06:40.530
Oh, that's right.

06:40.530 --> 06:44.590
His Majesty ordered us to increase the 
difficulty level for the test this year.

06:44.810 --> 06:47.900
Abandon the idea for this year. 
Next year will work just as well.

06:47.900 --> 06:49.610
How can I possibly give up on this?!

06:49.610 --> 06:53.400
I'm certain that His Majesty wants 
to find talented people like her,

06:53.400 --> 06:55.720
and that's why he issued that order!

06:55.720 --> 07:01.310
Still, this year's exam will be held just 
after His Majesty's birthday celebrations.

07:01.310 --> 07:04.340
Even if she starts studying 
now, she'll never pass.

07:04.340 --> 07:08.610
I also believe that she should 
take the physician's exam.

07:08.860 --> 07:10.100
Graham!

07:12.540 --> 07:13.890
She is...

07:16.030 --> 07:18.400
Rose is a true genius.

07:18.790 --> 07:23.480
She possesses abilities greater 
than any doctor I've ever met.

07:23.960 --> 07:25.610
Doctor Graham.

07:26.810 --> 07:29.920
I accepted her as my apprentice,

07:29.920 --> 07:33.560
but her abilities already 
far surpass my own.

07:34.930 --> 07:37.720
To think that you would 
speak so highly of anyone...

07:38.570 --> 07:42.640
To take the physician's exam, she'll need
recommendations from three professors.

07:42.640 --> 07:48.690
With me, Professor Graham, and Viscount 
Gaut, that makes three, exactly!

07:49.010 --> 07:51.620
Don't just forge ahead in this 
conversation on your own!

07:51.620 --> 07:55.460
Do you feel confident that 
you can pass the exam?

07:55.920 --> 07:57.660
I will do everything in my power to pass.

07:59.720 --> 08:01.140
All right.

08:01.140 --> 08:04.970
I'll write you a recommendation 
so that you can take the exam.

08:05.430 --> 08:07.210
Thank you!

08:07.210 --> 08:10.100
I'm looking forward to 
seeing what happens next!

08:16.070 --> 08:18.460
Oh, Miss Rose!

08:19.020 --> 08:21.960
It's much brighter now. Thank you.

08:24.450 --> 08:27.220
<i>I'm so glad they provided me with the 
means to take the exam.</i>

08:27.550 --> 08:30.360
<i>If I hadn't gotten recommendations 
from this hospital,</i>

08:30.360 --> 08:33.230
<i>I'd have had to think of another way.</i>

08:33.540 --> 08:38.800
Still, this year's exam will be held just 
after His Majesty's birthday celebrations.

08:39.810 --> 08:41.910
<i>His Majesty's birthday celebrations.</i>

08:43.120 --> 08:45.240
<i>In my first life,</i>

08:45.240 --> 08:48.750
<i>my engagement to the prince was announced 
at the birthday celebrations.</i>

08:49.690 --> 08:54.020
<i>Back then, I believed that 
a happy future awaited me.</i>

08:55.210 --> 08:56.170
<i>But...</i>

08:57.280 --> 09:00.160
<i>the person I loved never loved me in return.</i>

09:00.560 --> 09:05.390
<i>Even at the very end, I had 
never once seen him smile.</i>

09:09.990 --> 09:14.350
<i>This time, the announcement of 
our engagement won't happen...</i>

09:14.350 --> 09:17.920
<i>because I've chosen to walk a 
different path from His Highness.</i>

09:36.390 --> 09:37.810
Lord Ron.

09:41.910 --> 09:45.010
If I remember correctly... 
it's Rose, isn't it?

09:45.010 --> 09:47.570
Lord Ron, why are you here?

09:48.520 --> 09:49.640
W-Well...

09:52.040 --> 09:54.820
It's nothing. I only dropped 
by for a short time.

09:56.820 --> 09:58.450
<i>Now that I think about it, he...</i>

10:01.230 --> 10:02.780
Please wait!

10:04.370 --> 10:08.970
You came here for treatment, 
didn't you? I've been waiting!

10:11.090 --> 10:12.260
Yes.

10:12.260 --> 10:15.540
I'll examine you immediately. 
This way, please.

10:17.120 --> 10:19.760
You look pale.

10:20.000 --> 10:24.620
Do you find find it difficult to relieve 
your fatigue or ever feel a sense of lethargy?

10:24.620 --> 10:25.480
Yes.

10:26.260 --> 10:30.510
When did you first become 
aware of these symptoms?

10:30.510 --> 10:32.270
It was about two months ago.

10:32.760 --> 10:38.280
How is your appetite? And has there 
been any change in your weight?

10:38.280 --> 10:40.720
I feel I have less appetite than before.

10:41.270 --> 10:44.660
Then, let me ask you about your dizziness.

10:44.660 --> 10:49.280
Does the ceiling ever spin around, or 
have objects ever appeared out of focus?

10:49.550 --> 10:51.540
Yes, sometimes.

10:51.540 --> 10:53.800
<i>What am I doing?</i>

10:54.230 --> 10:59.770
<i>Even the acclaimed Imperial Cross Hospital 
couldn't determine the cause of my dizziness.</i>

10:59.770 --> 11:03.320
<i>It's impossible that she would find 
a correct diagnosis, and yet...</i>

11:04.390 --> 11:05.820
Excuse me just a moment.

11:07.410 --> 11:08.960
Wh-What are you doing?

11:09.210 --> 11:13.000
I'm checking your temperature and 
perspiration levels through palpation.

11:13.000 --> 11:14.020
Is something wrong?

11:14.020 --> 11:15.470
Um, no.

11:15.900 --> 11:18.500
Your temperature seems a little low.

11:20.910 --> 11:22.820
Excuse me just a moment.

11:24.390 --> 11:28.080
D-Do you really need to touch
 everywhere like this?

11:28.410 --> 11:32.590
It's necessary in order to achieve 
the most accurate diagnosis.

11:32.940 --> 11:36.500
<i>Don't tell me she's like this 
with other patients, too.</i>

11:37.010 --> 11:39.090
H-How long will you continue to touch me?

11:39.330 --> 11:41.620
There. I'm finished.

11:41.620 --> 11:44.230
If you'll wait just a moment, I'll explain.

11:45.860 --> 11:48.100
Should I wait here?

11:48.100 --> 11:51.690
Yes. Will that be a problem for you?

11:51.690 --> 11:55.270
It's nothing. I'm a little 
tired, that's all.

11:55.270 --> 11:59.610
Lord Ron, did you catch 
a cold two months ago?

11:59.830 --> 12:01.850
Yes, I did.

12:01.850 --> 12:06.710
At the time, did you feel any 
pain in the area I just touched?

12:07.050 --> 12:08.620
How do you know that?

12:09.070 --> 12:13.130
Lord Ron, you have subacute thyroiditis.

12:13.410 --> 12:14.980
Subacute...

12:16.470 --> 12:20.050
The thyroid is where thyroid hormone,

12:20.050 --> 12:22.620
which regulates our bodies' 
fuel, is created.

12:23.120 --> 12:29.850
That gland is inflamed, and as a result, 
it's producing less thyroid hormone.

12:29.850 --> 12:33.000
Is it an illness that will require surgery?

12:33.620 --> 12:37.840
No. If you take your medicine,
 you should recover quite quickly.

12:39.930 --> 12:41.150
I see.

12:41.590 --> 12:44.070
I'll write you a prescription.

12:44.070 --> 12:46.870
Please go to the pharmacy 
to pick up your medicine.

12:46.870 --> 12:49.900
I will. Is that the end of my treatment?

12:49.900 --> 12:53.020
No. Please return in three days.

12:53.420 --> 12:57.410
I'll check the progress of your symptoms 
and adjust your dosage.

12:57.710 --> 13:00.730
I'd like for you to come back over 
the course of the next two months.

13:00.730 --> 13:01.930
Two months?

13:02.710 --> 13:04.950
If it will be difficult for you to come here,

13:04.950 --> 13:08.680
you can receive treatment at 
Imperial Cross Hospital instead.

13:09.010 --> 13:11.370
In that case, we'd send them our report.

13:11.370 --> 13:13.930
No, it's fine. I'll come back here.

13:31.190 --> 13:34.170
And how have you felt since then?

13:34.170 --> 13:36.980
It's shocking how much better I feel.

13:36.980 --> 13:38.370
It's all thanks to you.

13:39.260 --> 13:40.500
I'm glad to help.

13:40.960 --> 13:44.230
Now, what treatment do 
you have for me today?

13:44.230 --> 13:46.300
Will you start with palpation again?

13:46.300 --> 13:49.710
After this visit, you won't 
have to come back anymore.

13:49.710 --> 13:51.410
Wh-What?

13:51.920 --> 13:54.010
Your progress is excellent.

13:54.010 --> 13:56.800
You just need to continue 
taking your medicine.

13:57.510 --> 14:00.530
So, this is the end of my treatment?

14:01.230 --> 14:04.240
Yes. Please take care on your way home.

14:27.340 --> 14:28.440
Whew...

14:31.890 --> 14:34.690
Lord Ron? Why are you here?

14:34.690 --> 14:37.000
Your treatment has concluded.

14:37.000 --> 14:39.400
It's just, well...

14:39.910 --> 14:41.730
I was taking a stroll.

14:41.730 --> 14:43.400
Oh, I see.

14:43.400 --> 14:47.530
<i>I can't tell her that I came because 
I wanted to see her face.</i>

14:47.890 --> 14:49.830
I'll just carry this, then.

14:49.830 --> 14:51.950
What? I can't ask you to do that!

14:52.410 --> 14:54.200
I don't mind. Let's go.

14:57.690 --> 15:00.300
Um, I'm all right now.

15:00.570 --> 15:02.350
No, I'll help.

15:02.350 --> 15:04.900
You say you'll help, but...

15:04.900 --> 15:08.650
Pardon my rudeness, Lord Ron, but 
do you have experience cleaning?

15:08.650 --> 15:09.840
None at all.

15:10.380 --> 15:12.850
Then, I'll teach you.

15:13.110 --> 15:17.350
A mop is used like this. This 
is how we clean the floors.

15:17.890 --> 15:19.010
Like this?

15:21.680 --> 15:24.060
Please put a little more strength into it!

15:24.060 --> 15:24.990
Like this!

15:25.590 --> 15:27.110
L-Like this.

15:27.110 --> 15:28.360
That's right!

15:28.590 --> 15:31.610
In a medical environment, cleanliness 
is the most important thing!

15:31.890 --> 15:33.520
I-I see.

15:42.540 --> 15:45.170
There's more depth to 
cleaning than I imagined.

15:46.330 --> 15:47.930
You've done very good work here.

15:47.930 --> 15:48.920
Thanks.

15:48.920 --> 15:52.620
You've helped me in so many 
ways today. Thank you.

15:52.620 --> 15:54.130
Nothing to deserve thanks.

15:54.520 --> 15:56.890
Lord Ron, you're a kind person.

15:59.770 --> 16:01.290
<i>Lord Ron, is it?</i>

16:01.940 --> 16:05.850
<i>So, when she's happy, this 
is how she smiles...</i>

16:11.780 --> 16:12.890
Your Highness.

16:13.340 --> 16:14.520
What is it?

16:14.520 --> 16:19.860
Where have you been going lately, leaving 
a mountain of accumulated work behind?

16:20.570 --> 16:22.790
Ah, well...

16:24.160 --> 16:27.580
If you're troubled by 
something, please tell me.

16:27.970 --> 16:30.300
What does your sibling like?

16:30.640 --> 16:32.050
Do you mean Chris?

16:32.300 --> 16:34.160
I mean Lady Elise.

16:34.160 --> 16:36.770
My little sister? Has she been a nuisance again?

16:36.770 --> 16:38.050
That's not it.

16:38.380 --> 16:41.090
I have need to express my thanks to her.

16:41.090 --> 16:45.430
But it doesn't bear any particular 
emotional weight. Don't let it bother you

16:45.430 --> 16:47.690
I'm not particularly troubled by it.

16:49.380 --> 16:50.470
I'm glad to hear it.

16:51.080 --> 16:54.590
In any case, I'd like to 
know her preferences.

16:54.930 --> 16:58.970
Well, Lise enjoys eating.

16:58.970 --> 16:59.840
What?

17:00.540 --> 17:03.570
In particular, she can't 
resist a strawberry cake.

17:05.160 --> 17:06.590
Anything else?

17:06.590 --> 17:09.700
Mango pudding and banana tarts.

17:09.700 --> 17:12.080
Oh, but she hates milk, so...

17:12.080 --> 17:14.510
That's not what I'm asking!

17:16.030 --> 17:17.590
Something more...

17:18.850 --> 17:21.790
A gift worthy of giving to a lady.

17:22.060 --> 17:25.300
A gift... for a lady?

17:27.070 --> 17:28.800
<i>That's right.</i>

17:28.800 --> 17:32.170
<i>Ren's devoted to his work, 
and he's a very earnest man.</i>

17:32.170 --> 17:35.440
<i>Consulting him about something of 
this nature was never going to work.</i>

17:36.380 --> 17:39.820
<i>Someone well-versed in 
this subject would be...</i>

17:40.170 --> 17:44.540
<i>Right. Mikhail would know 
far more than I do.</i>

17:45.580 --> 17:48.080
<i>No. That would be ridiculous of me.</i>

17:48.670 --> 17:49.700
Your Highness.

17:51.080 --> 17:52.660
Have you thought of something?

17:53.400 --> 17:55.340
Would jewels suit?

17:55.340 --> 17:56.370
What?

17:56.370 --> 18:02.760
When I think about it, Elise has 
always liked dazzling, gaudy things.

18:03.550 --> 18:08.830
<i>Yes. I've heard rumors about 
her that say the same.</i>

18:10.840 --> 18:12.750
<i>And yet, I'm not sure why, but...</i>

18:12.750 --> 18:17.870
<i>I can't imagine that receiving jewels 
would make her smile that way.</i>

18:18.600 --> 18:22.650
<i>Though, if Ren says so, 
I suppose I could try it.</i>

18:23.370 --> 18:24.860
No, thank you.

18:27.980 --> 18:33.210
This is to express my
gratitude for saving Randall.

18:33.210 --> 18:36.210
There's no special meaning attached. 
Please don't let it trouble you.

18:36.210 --> 18:39.020
I'm not particularly troubled by it.

18:39.020 --> 18:40.250
Then, why?

18:40.520 --> 18:43.640
I only did what a doctor should.

18:43.640 --> 18:46.670
I can't accept something like this for it.

18:47.300 --> 18:49.730
I see. My apologies.

18:50.270 --> 18:52.190
No, I'm the one who's sorry.

18:52.190 --> 18:54.600
You went to so much trouble for this...

18:54.600 --> 18:57.190
I do gratefully accept the 
thought behind the gift.

18:57.520 --> 19:01.830
It's all right. I thought 
you might say that.

19:01.830 --> 19:05.650
But I won't be able to rest easy until 
I've repaid the debt I owe you.

19:05.650 --> 19:07.910
I've received the fee for the treatment.

19:07.910 --> 19:10.450
I feel that's more than enough.

19:10.450 --> 19:12.760
Do you mean that negligible fee?

19:13.340 --> 19:15.500
Isn't there anything else you want?

19:17.970 --> 19:20.750
In that case, let's see...

19:20.750 --> 19:23.890
Will you treat me to a 
strawberry cake one day?

19:23.890 --> 19:24.830
What?

19:24.830 --> 19:27.910
I absolutely adore strawberry cake!

19:27.910 --> 19:32.450
But my family says I'll eat too much of it, 
so they won't let me have it very often.

19:32.730 --> 19:34.470
What about mango pudding?

19:34.470 --> 19:37.230
Yes! I adore that, too!

19:37.460 --> 19:41.110
You love banana tarts, too, 
don't you? And you hate milk.

19:41.320 --> 19:43.340
What? how do you know that?

19:46.050 --> 19:48.760
From now on, I'll let you 
eat as much as you like.

19:54.380 --> 19:55.890
I'll visit again.

20:06.690 --> 20:09.670
I'm sorry to call you here so suddenly.

20:09.670 --> 20:13.780
I actually wanted to ask you 
about the girl called Rose.

20:14.020 --> 20:17.770
I heard that she's working at 
your hospital as an apprentice.

20:18.020 --> 20:21.650
Yes, sire. I have worked as 
a doctor for many years,

20:21.650 --> 20:24.030
and she is, without a doubt, a genius.

20:24.310 --> 20:27.950
It's almost as if she were 
born to become a doctor.

20:29.030 --> 20:30.420
I see.

20:31.240 --> 20:33.880
Is there something about Rose I should know?

20:33.880 --> 20:37.430
You need only answer
the questions you're asked.

20:37.680 --> 20:38.520
Yes, sir!

20:39.390 --> 20:43.690
Are the preparations for the physician 
qualification exam underway?

20:44.120 --> 20:48.810
As Your Majesty ordered, the questions which 
will appear have been carefully selected.

20:49.930 --> 20:53.350
As a doctor holds others' lives in their hands,

20:53.350 --> 20:57.260
we must be sure that those who are 
unqualified do not pass the exam.

20:57.260 --> 20:58.830
That is all I have to say.

20:58.830 --> 21:01.150
Yes, sire. I will take my leave.

21:04.990 --> 21:08.930
You think of some entertaining 
things, Sir Vent.

21:08.930 --> 21:10.950
Sire, you praise me too highly.

21:11.420 --> 21:14.580
When I first heard, I was surprised.

21:14.580 --> 21:18.210
Let's raise the difficulty level 
of the physician's exam, indeed.

21:18.210 --> 21:23.390
Our empire needs her acumen and lineage.

21:23.390 --> 21:26.720
She must become the next empress, 
no matter what it takes.

21:26.720 --> 21:31.690
Well, if she truly is a born doctor,

21:31.690 --> 21:34.610
then it's best she face 
an ordeal of this level.

21:34.820 --> 21:39.350
Your Majesty, there is actually one 
more idea I would like to propose.

21:40.220 --> 21:41.350
What is it?

21:42.370 --> 21:47.530
That at your birthday celebrations, 
you announce the lady's engagement.

21:48.920 --> 21:52.620
But what of my wager with her?

21:52.620 --> 21:57.530
Are you saying that I should 
rescind a promise I've made?

22:01.200 --> 22:04.510
I have an idea about that.

22:06.260 --> 22:10.010
Ordeal
